  "title": "LaTeX-aware structural ingestion and atomic tabular chunking",
  "status": "SCAFFOLDED \u2014 NO ARM EXECUTED",
  "status_detail": "Implementation, tests, harness, statistics and gates are complete and verified. Neither the control nor the treatment arm has been run: the audit environment has no GPU, no torch/sentence-transformers/chromadb/pymupdf, no Ollama, and the canonical corpus is gitignored and absent. No metric value in this repository is a result of EXP-LATEX-01.",
  "primary_hypothesis": "LaTeX-aware ingestion improves structural fidelity (table binding, anchor delivery, equation preservation, structured evidence extraction) while maintaining numeric fidelity, provenance, attribution, abstention and deterministic behaviour.",
  "secondary_hypothesis": "Atomic treatment of LaTeX tabular environments prevents chunk splitting from destroying table structure.",
